      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nSituated on the south side of Drogheda in the mature and well-established residential estate of Ballsgrove, this property enjoys a highly convenient location close to a wide range of local amenities, including schools, shops and public transport links. Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital is within easy reach, while the M1 motorway is just a 2-minute drive away, providing excellent access to Dublin Airport and the Greater Dublin Area.\r\n\r\nProperty Overview\r\nThis spacious two-storey end-terrace residence extends to approximately 97 m² and offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property has been well maintained and provides bright and flexible living space suitable for first-time buyers, families and investors alike.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance porch, hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, shower room, three bedrooms and attic room.\r\n\r\nThe long rear garden is private and laid out in lawn, offering excellent outdoor space.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\nMature residential location\r\nThree bedrooms\r\nAttic room.\r\nPrivate rear garden\r\nOil-fired central heating\r\nClose to schools and amenities\r\nExcellent accessibility to the M1 Motorway\r\nBER Rating: C\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nPorch: 0.93m × 1.84m (3'1\" × 6')\r\nEntrance Hall: 3.08m × 1.84m (10'1\" × 6')\r\nInner Hallway with under-stairs storage\r\nSitting Room: 4.82m × 3.33m (15'10\" × 10'11\")\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: 2.27m × 5.27m (7'5\" × 17'4\")\r\nBathroom: 2.43m × 2.22m (8' × 7'3\")\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1: 3.11m × 5.34m (10'3\" × 17'6\")\r\nBedroom 2: 3.63m × 3.18m (11'11\" × 10'5\")\r\nBedroom 3: 2.27m × 2.73m (7'5\" × 9')\r\nCentral landing with stairs connecting floors\r\nSecond Floor\r\nAttic Room: 3.17m (10'5\") × 4.39m (14'5\") maximum\r\nSmall landing area at the top of the stairs\r\n\r\nServices\r\nMains Water\r\nMains Sewerage\r\nMains Electricity\r\nOil-Fired Central Heating\r\n\r\nViewing\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this well-located family home has to offer.\r\n\r\nContact Ciaran to arrange a viewing appointment."
      },
